description: Visual craft for the egui shell
globs: crates/app/**/*.rs
alwaysApply: false
---

Colors, type, and chrome sizes live in `crates/app/src/ui/mod.rs`. Motion uses `ctx.animate_bool_with_time`, as `hover_scale` does at `0.18`.

## Color and type

- Paint with `BG`, `PANEL`, `CANVAS_BG`, `ACCENT`, `TEXT`, `MUTED`, and `SELECT_BG`. A new color joins that warm set in `mod.rs`. `ACCENT` is the only highlight.
- Names use `RichText::strong` and `TEXT`. Secondary lines use `MUTED`. Text on an accent fill is black, as Create and Choose folder are.
- Reuse the sizes already on screen: title 22, name 16, body 14, meta 13.

## Layout

- New chrome joins the toolbar, the editor, or the rail.
- A home card uses `card_frame`. Editor chrome sits flat on `BG` and `PANEL`.
- Related controls share the current `Margin` and `ui.spacing`. A gap between groups is larger than the gap inside a group.
- Icon buttons stay at the existing 30–34px side. Crop handles stay at `CROP_HANDLE_HIT`.
- Long names go through `short_name`. A row still reads with a one-letter name, a very long filename, an empty list, and a large count.

## Motion

- A hover, an open, or an occasional state change may animate. Drag, zoom, nudge, and undo update on the same frame.
- An entrance or press finishes in 0.1–0.25s and starts fast. A move that stays on screen eases through the middle. A spinner stays linear.
- Something appearing starts near full size and fades. `hover_scale` (`1.0 + 0.06 * t`) is the size of a scale change.
- A clickable row sets `CursorIcon::PointingHand`.

## Copy and states

- A button names the action ("Create template", "Choose folder").
- An empty screen names what is missing ("No templates yet.").
- Loading and failure stay visible in `status` or an inline label ("Estimating size…") until the work ends.
